# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Business & customer data — NEVER commit.
# netlify.toml publishes from the repo root, so any committed
# file is fetchable at hackynation.com/<path>. Committing these
# would publish customer emails, payment records and contracts.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Contracts/
Order Sheets/
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.docx
*.doc

# Business PDFs (fulfillment, contracts, shipment lists).
# Design/print PDFs (logos, print files) are deliberately not matched.
Contract*.pdf
USL_*.pdf
Hacky Nation Master Sheet*.pdf
*shipment list*.pdf
shirts organizer.pdf
hacky count*.pdf

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local working archives — large, not for deploy.
# Source files live here; the site only ships what's in src/.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Inspiration for new site/
Branding/
Sacks/
Posts/
*.zip
**/_orig/
